-- Reviewed by construction group: relative coordinate comparison and finite
-- deduplication; finite ring and reducedness verification; coefficient-map
-- verification; Gaussian corner bases; mapped idempotent splitting and
-- polynomial representatives; weak product assembly and regressions.
-- Ring carrier/operations are opened at model and fixed-point boundaries.
-- The shared exact endpoint retains the same Gaussian computation.
